        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Fragment composed of two pieces of silk in the ‘bizarre’ style. Design shows a column form alternating with a flower vase with swag, and large florals in pink, blue and yellow. nk flowers and a spiral column. Rich use of gold and silver with limited brocaded silk colors. Red-orange foundation fabric limited to linear details or small areas of background. Silver and gold tarnished."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/de4ea843-8dcb-3700-b5fa-da9e5b8940ce> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Fragment composed of two pieces of silk in the ‘bizarre’ style. Design shows a column form alternating with a flower vase with swag, and large florals in pink, blue and yellow. nk flowers and a spiral column. Rich use of gold and silver with limited brocaded silk colors. Red-orange foundation fabric limited to linear details or small areas of background. Silver and gold tarnished."@en ;
